metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d16r7o1hw8apt"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_wh43b"]
script = ExtResource("3_hevnk")
text = "As the years passed, priests found more and more fault in animals. They declared them to be evil spirits, abominations against the Enlightened One's natural order, and posted bounties, offering rewards for tails and pelts. This backfired when several residents of $nonshrine_town were found to be secretly raising lizards to harvest their tails."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_5g2iv")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_sdsiy"]
script = ExtResource("4_hevnk")
scope = 1
event_id = "defiled_shrine"
var_id = "guards"
var_type = 1
value = "true"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d16r7o1hw8apt"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_4rr4y"]
script = ExtResource("3_hevnk")
text = "As shrines were built in other towns on the shard, they also enforced the ban on laypeople. However, an exception was made for those who wanted to present offerings to the Enlightened One. To make sure no commoner could pretend to be a monk, laws were instituted allowing only monks to wear orange clothing. For unclear reasons, this was later expanded to include all dyed clothing, and eventually required laypeople to dress only in clothing made of rough, undyed hemp."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_sdsiy")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_i6f8j"]
script = ExtResource("4_hevnk")
scope = 1
event_id = "defiled_shrine"
var_id = "questioning"
var_type = 1
value = "true"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d16r7o1hw8apt"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_kbqek"]
script = ExtResource("3_hevnk")
text = "To handle the growing number of accusations, the priests established a specialized branch of the order. These magistrates patrol the streets with absolute authority to detain and question anyone, bypassing judges and town councils. They also keep detailed records of all inhabitants, and failure to register is considered a punishable offense."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_i6f8j")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_se72s"]
script = ExtResource("4_hevnk")
scope = 1
event_id = "defiled_shrine"
var_id = "forgiven"
var_type = 1
value = "true"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d16r7o1hw8apt"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_qsk3h"]
script = ExtResource("3_hevnk")
text = "With the shrine's many child patrons, the monks decided to start hosting regular sessions to teach the holy glyphs, and the place soon turned into a school that also taught writing, arithmetic, and natural philosophy. Smaller shrines in other towns followed suit, and thanks to these schools, $shard_name has become one of the most literate places in the Cloud Sea."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_se72s")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cy8bar8yxvc7q"

